WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.497
Warning! Warning!

2
00:00:01.497 --> 00:00:06.705
I built this with AI and text to speech, because I can't narrate for shit!

3
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:09.234
Hey, Dreamer here.

4
00:00:09.234 --> 00:00:13.769
We've got a map, a job and a rival show, but nobody living in any of it.

5
00:00:13.769 --> 00:00:14.769
Today, people.

6
00:00:14.769 --> 00:00:16.343
And yes, I'm one of them.

7
00:00:17.733 --> 00:00:20.963
Open Characters, then NPCs, then World NPCs.

8
00:00:20.963 --> 00:00:28.229
So far there's me, Old Marla the lion tamer, Mayor Pettigrew, and Lucius Gilt from the Gilt Circus.

9
00:00:29.633 --> 00:00:31.265
Let's open the handsome one.

10
00:00:31.265 --> 00:00:34.471
Name is what players see on the card, so keep it short.

11
00:00:34.471 --> 00:00:38.318
There's a proper name too, for someone hiding who they really are.

12
00:00:38.767 --> 00:00:45.105
Basic info is what the narrator reads, so anything you want described in play goes here: who they are,

13
00:00:45.105 --> 00:00:48.647
one thing you'd notice, and what they're doing right now.

14
00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:52.289
Hidden info is what the player doesn't know yet.

15
00:00:52.289 --> 00:00:56.542
Mine? I saw who let the lion out, and I'm saving it for a crowd.

16
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:01.430
Personality is a list of things they do, not words like clever.

17
00:01:01.430 --> 00:01:04.523
Grins wider the worse things get. That's me.

18
00:01:04.967 --> 00:01:11.369
Initial relationship is where they start with the players, from minus a hundred to a hundred.

19
00:01:11.369 --> 00:01:12.539
I start at forty.

20
00:01:12.539 --> 00:01:14.742
Leave it empty and the AI picks.

21
00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:18.381
Current location and area say where they stand.

22
00:01:18.381 --> 00:01:25.080
Leave the location empty, like Lucius Gilt, and they stay off stage until something brings them in.

23
00:01:25.533 --> 00:01:27.517
Tier sets how tough they are.

24
00:01:27.517 --> 00:01:31.896
Civilians are trivial, and named story people are usually elite.

25
00:01:32.333 --> 00:01:36.108
And voice tag picks their voice from Voyage's catalogue.

26
00:01:36.108 --> 00:01:39.613
Leave it empty and one gets matched to them in play.

27
00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.091
Voyage's own tips, short version.

28
00:01:43.091 --> 00:01:48.475
Basic info is who they are, one thing you'd notice, and what they're up to right now.

29
00:01:48.475 --> 00:01:53.987
Hidden info is the secret, what they really want, how they hide it, and who else knows.

30
00:01:53.987 --> 00:01:56.901
Personality is things they do, not adjectives.

31
00:01:58.300 --> 00:01:59.392
Now the portrait.

32
00:01:59.392 --> 00:02:03.825
Same walk as before: Characters, then NPCs, then World NPCs, then me.

33
00:02:03.825 --> 00:02:06.138
Up top, click the starting portrait.

34
00:02:06.138 --> 00:02:10.699
Drop in your own picture, at least six hundred pixels, or generate one.

35
00:02:11.133 --> 00:02:13.519
The prompt is only framing and mood.

36
00:02:13.519 --> 00:02:19.551
What I look like comes from my basic info, or the visual description box if you fill it in.

37
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:25.533
Generating uses your Usage, and this one takes a little while, so we'll skip ahead.

38
00:02:25.967 --> 00:02:29.150
And there I am, top hat, orbs and all, ciggie lit.

39
00:02:29.150 --> 00:02:35.324
Regenerate makes another one, Crop picks the part that shows on my card, and Save Draft keeps it.

40
00:02:36.733 --> 00:02:38.413
And you can leave it empty.

41
00:02:38.413 --> 00:02:41.462
A person with no portrait gets one drawn in play.

42
00:02:41.462 --> 00:02:44.511
That's what Marla, the mayor and Lucius will get.

43
00:02:44.511 --> 00:02:49.365
Uploading your own keeps the face clear of the edges, since the card crops it.

44
00:02:50.767 --> 00:02:52.129
That's people, part one.

45
00:02:52.129 --> 00:02:55.079
Everyone from this one is linked in the description.

46
00:02:55.079 --> 00:02:57.803
Next time, the rest of the people folder: types,

47
00:02:57.803 --> 00:03:00.867
factions, and the bits Voyage uses to make up its own.

48
00:03:01.333 --> 00:03:05.281
I'm Dreamer. Now go build something weird, and I'll see you next time!

